    "title": "Monster Masters",
    "description": "Fast monster battles! Collect, fight with and evolve monsters to become a legend!\r\nCan you fight to become the ultimate master and breed the best monster army? Monster Masters is a real-time multiplayer game where you\u2019ll use strategy and powerful monsters to unleash attacks in action-packed PVP battles. Assemble your monsters and prepare to fight your challengers in the ultimate monster competition!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\u25cf Battle competitors from around the world in real-time action PVP monster fights\r\n\u25cf Earn Boxes to unlock rewards, collect powerful new monsters and fight with your monsters in the arena!\r\n\u25cf Defeat opponent\u2019s monsters with your ultimate battle strategy to win Fame and become a legend among monster masters \r\n\u25cf Collect and evolve dozens of monsters with new battle moves, then summon your monsters to the arena to compete in multiplayer battles!\r\n\u25cf Create a strategy for your ultimate monster team to defeat your opponents in battle\r\n\u25cf Progress through multiple Leagues and evolve to become a hero of the competition!\r\n\u25cf Challenge your friends to a private duel to see whose monsters fight to come out on top\r\n\r\n\r\n--> TWITTER: https://twitter.com/MonsterMasterss\r\n--> INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/MonsterMastersOfficial\r\n--> FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/MonsterMastersOfficial\r\n--> DISCORD: https://discord.gg/5mntHNU\r\n--> WEBSITE: lanpartygames.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fast monster battles! Collect, fight with and evolve monsters to become a legend!<br>Can you fight to become the ultimate master and breed the best monster army? Monster Masters is a real-time multiplayer game where you\u2019ll use strategy and powerful monsters to unleash attacks in action-packed PVP battles. Assemble your monsters and prepare to fight your challengers in the ultimate monster competition!<br><br>FEATURES<br>\u25cf Battle competitors from around the world in real-time action PVP monster fights<br>\u25cf Earn Boxes to unlock rewards, collect powerful new monsters and fight with your monsters in the arena!<br>\u25cf Defeat opponent\u2019s monsters with your ultimate battle strategy to win Fame and become a legend among monster masters <br>\u25cf Collect and evolve dozens of monsters with new battle moves, then summon your monsters to the arena to compete in multiplayer battles!<br>\u25cf Create a strategy for your ultimate monster team to defeat your opponents in battle<br>\u25cf Progress through multiple Leagues and evolve to become a hero of the competition!<br>\u25cf Challenge your friends to a private duel to see whose monsters fight to come out on top<br><br><br>--&gt; TWITTER: https://twitter.com/MonsterMasterss<br>--&gt; INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/MonsterMastersOfficial<br>--&gt; FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/MonsterMastersOfficial<br>--&gt; DISCORD: https://discord.gg/5mntHNU<br>--&gt; WEBSITE: lanpartygames.com",
